  "description": "Demolition of existing building- Construction of part 2, part 3 and part 4 storey building with basement to create one A1 shop unit on ground floor and basement, 2 x B1 (Commercial) units on ground floor and basement, 4 x 2 bed flats and 1 x 1 bed flat above.",
